    <string name="vpn_persistence_message">AdAway already handles reboots, low-memory kills and crashes on its own, so no extra setup is needed in most cases.\n\nIf the VPN ever stops unexpectedly, pin AdAway as the Android system Always-on VPN for the strongest guarantee.</string>
    <string name="vpn_persistence_adb_commands">If the system VPN screen is hidden on your TV, use ADB, then restart the TV:\n\n• Enable always-on for AdAway:\n  adb shell settings put secure always_on_vpn_app %1$s\n\n• Disable always-on:\n  adb shell settings delete secure always_on_vpn_app</string>
